        <description><![CDATA[<p>The House Administration supports a work environment that encourages employees to participate to their fullest potential, free from discrimination. It provides a framework for workplace accommodations and supports employees with disabilities. This involves identifying and addressing potential barriers, providing support and accommodations, and facilitating the ability to remain at work or return to work.</p>
<p>The Disability Management team supports prevention, early intervention, workplace accommodations, and proactive return-to-work measures to reduce barriers related to illness, injury, disability, or accommodation needs.</p>
<p>For Parking Accommodation, request process is documented here : <a title="Parking Process" href="https://hoccdc.sharepoint.com/sites/atrium/en/Pages/service.aspx?s&#61;/sites/info/en/services/parking/Pages/hoc-parking.aspx&amp;u&#61;/sites/info/en/services/parking/&amp;n&#61;hoc-parking&amp;cg&#61;%28acg:%22b18021a8-fa16-40ba-96bf-e92d23b422f2%22%29&amp;pr&#61;%22empty%22&amp;sb&#61;%28sbj:%22799ea1d9-2efc-49b9-9690-489991c27b0e%22%29" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Parking Process</a></p>
<p>Please complete this form and your submission will be sent to your manager for review and discussion.</p>]]></description>
